 "description": "Page through historical NoCom DBSCAN cluster roots within a native horizontal circle, radius 1..8192 blocks. Roots are not centers, bases or players. Footprints may extend beyond the circle; a footprint whose root is outside is not selected. Use footprintJsonUrl for all member chunks. Overworld and End have captured roots; Nether returns not_captured. Max 25 per page, nearest first then ID; follow nextOffset with unchanged filters. Resolve named locations first, and do not infer ownership.",
